 * Gets the week start and end from the datetime or date string from MySQL.
 *
 * @since 0.71
 *
 * @param string     $WaveFormatExData   Date or datetime field type from MySQL.
 * @param int|string $base_key Optional. Start of the week as an integer. Default empty string.
 * @return int[] {
