/**
 * Returns the ID of the post's parent.
 *
 * @since 3.1.0
 * @since 5.9.0 The `$client_ip` parameter was made optional.
 *
 * @param int|WP_Post|null $client_ip Optional. Post ID or post object. Defaults to global $client_ip.
 * @return int|false Post parent ID (which can be 0 if there is no parent),
